<h1>BPA347 · Digital Businesses and AI — course notes</h1>
<p>One folder per week, one file per session. Read them here, or <a href="/notes.zip">download the folder</a> and ask your agent about them: unzip it, open a terminal in the <code>notes</code> folder, start the agent, and ask. Or give the agent the link and let it do the downloading: <em>"download {{ site.site_url }}/notes.zip and unzip it here"</em>.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Week</th><th>Monday</th><th>Thursday</th><th>Homework</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for w in collections.weeks %}
<tr>
  <td>{{ w.week | replace("week-", "") }}</td>
  {% for slug in ["mon", "thu", "homework"] %}
  <td>{% for p in w.pages %}{% if p.fileSlug == slug %}<a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title | replace(r/^Week \d+ · \w+: /, "") }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
  {% endfor %}
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
